 "remarks": "Why You'll Love It: br  Zero Utility Stress: Rent includes electric, water, gas, heat, AND hot water! Just set up your Wi-Fi, and you're good to go.     Turnkey & Stylish: Move-in ready with fully furnished living and dining areas, plus a spacious, fully equipped kitchen.      Room to Breathe: Enjoy two comfy upstairs bedrooms (the 3rd is reserved for discrete owner storage), in- unit basement laundry, and bonus garage storage.     Outdoor Chill Spots: Unwind on your welcoming front porch, host weekend BBQs in the private yard and patio, and park easily with a private driveway plus street parking.   The Location? Absolute Gold.    NYC Commuter's Dream: Ditch the traffic! Walk ~15 minutes to the Port Chester Metro-North station and land in Manhattan in under 45 minutes. Quick, easy access to I-95, too.     Beach & Recreation: Walk ~15 minutes to Byram Beach, the local pool, tennis courts, boat launch, park, and library.     Foodie Haven: A short stroll takes you right into downtown Port Chester-famous for its legendary dining scene, nightlife, and entertainment.",
